sequenceDiagram
    actor Engineer as Supervising Engineer
    participant View as Quality View
    participant Controller as QualityController
    participant Service as QualityService
    participant Db as ApplicationDbContext
    Engineer->>View: Tạo yêu cầu nghiệm thu
    View->>Controller: POST CreateInspection
    Controller->>Service: CreateInspection
    Service->>Db: Kiểm tra RequiresInspection
    Service->>Db: Lưu InspectionRequest
    Engineer->>View: Ghi nhận kết quả
    View->>Controller: POST RecordInspection
    Controller->>Service: RecordInspection
    alt Đạt
        Service->>Db: Task Completed
    else Không đạt
        Service->>Db: Task NeedsRework và lưu khắc phục
    end
    Service->>Db: Lưu InspectionHistory
